@startuml network-flows-table
' ============================================================================
' LinID Identity Manager — Network Flows (Table View)
' Companion to network-flows.puml — renders as a sortable table.
' ============================================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam noteFontSize 8

title LinID Identity Manager — Network Flows (Table)

note
  **Current flows (F1–F20)**
  |= ID |= Source |= Destination |= Port |= Protocol |= Direction |= Authentication |= Encryption |= Scope |
  | F1  | Admin     | UI (Nginx)       | 9000 -> 443 | HTTPS      | Inbound  | OIDC session cookie    | TLS  | External |
  | F2  | End user  | UI (Nginx)       | 9000 -> 443 | HTTPS      | Inbound  | OIDC session cookie    | TLS  | External |
  | F3  | Admin     | Apache Superset  | 8088 -> 8443| HTTPS      | Inbound  | Username / password    | TLS  | External |
  | F4  | Admin     | LinID API        | 8443        | HTTPS      | Inbound  | JWT                    | TLS  | External |
  | F5  | Admin     | LemonLDAP::NG    | 8080 -> 80  | HTTP       | Inbound  | Username / password    | None | External |
  | F6  | UI (Nginx)| LinID API        | 8443        | HTTPS/REST | Outbound | JWT bearer             | TLS  | Internal |
  | F7  | UI (Nginx)| LemonLDAP::NG    | 80          | HTTP       | Outbound | OIDC session           | None | Internal |
  | F8  | UI (Nginx)| Catalog UI       | 80          | HTTP       | Outbound | None                   | None | Internal |
  | F9  | LinID API | PostgreSQL       | 5432        | JDBC       | Outbound | DB user / password     | None | Internal |
  | F10 | LinID API | OPA              | 8181        | REST/HTTP  | Outbound | None                   | None | Internal |
  | F11 | LinID API | LemonLDAP::NG    | 80          | HTTPS      | Outbound | None (public JWKS)     | TLS  | Internal |
  | F12 | LinID API | Apache Superset  | 8443        | REST/HTTPS | Outbound | Service account        | TLS  | Internal |
  | F13 | LemonLDAP | PostgreSQL       | 5432        | DBI/Pg     | Outbound | DB user / password     | None | Internal |
  | F14 | Superset  | PostgreSQL       | 5432        | SQLAlchemy | Outbound | DB user / password     | None | Internal |
  | F15 | Superset  | PostgreSQL       | 5432        | SQLAlchemy | Outbound | DB user / password     | None | Internal |
  | F16 | Init DB   | PostgreSQL       | 5432        | psql       | Outbound | DB admin password      | None | Internal |
  | F17 | Init DB   | LinID API        | 8443        | HTTPS      | Outbound | None                   | TLS  | Internal |
  | F18 | Init Sup. | Apache Superset  | 8443        | REST/HTTPS | Outbound | Service account        | TLS  | Internal |
  | F19 | E2E       | UI (Nginx)       | 443         | HTTPS      | Outbound | None                   | TLS  | Internal |
  | F20 | E2E       | LinID API        | 8443        | HTTPS/REST | Outbound | JWT                    | TLS  | Internal |
  ~~~~~~
  **Future flows (F21–F25) — target architecture, not yet implemented**
  |= ID |= Source |= Destination |= Port |= Protocol |= Direction |= Authentication |= Encryption |= Scope |
  | F21 | Flink     | OPA              | 8181        | REST/HTTP  | Outbound | None                   | None | Internal |
  | F22 | Flink     | PostgreSQL       | 5432        | JDBC       | Outbound | DB user / password     | None | Internal |
  | F23 | Flink     | LDAP Directory   | 389 / 636   | LDAP       | Outbound | Service account        | TLS (LDAPS) | Internal |
  | F24 | LemonLDAP | LDAP Directory   | 389 / 636   | LDAP       | Outbound | Service account        | TLS (LDAPS) | Internal |
  | F25 | Superset  | Trino (S3)       | 8080        | SQL        | Outbound | DB user / password     | TLS  | Internal |
  ~~~~~~
  **Notes**
  • F7: The UI Nginx proxies /auth/ to LemonLDAP over plain HTTP inside the Docker network.
    The browser-to-UI connection (F1/F2) is TLS-encrypted; the proxy leg is not.
  • F11: The API fetches OIDC JWKS from LemonLDAP over HTTPS using a truststore
    (truststore.jks containing LemonLDAP's self-signed certificate).
  • F14/F15: Superset connects to two different databases (superset metadata + datalake)
    on the same PostgreSQL instance, same port, different DB names and credentials.
  • F23/F24: LDAP port 389 (STARTTLS) or 636 (LDAPS) — to be confirmed at implementation time.
end note

@enduml